            {
              "name": "slot",
              "width": 7,
              "note": "Which slot: a script's own spell slot as it stands, a summoner spell's plus 4 and an extra slot's plus 41. Where that passes the last slot of its kind (3, 40 or 48) a client sends 0, and where it comes to less than 0 it sends nothing."
